    "description": "Search accessible descendants of one folder by file name or UTF-8 text, without a subfolder-depth limit. Scans retain entry, time and content limits. mode filename does not read contents. mode content returns one bounded snippet per file unless groupBy is match. Pass the same arguments plus cursor for the next page.",
